#: scenario2:scenario2_111F5064_ADFE_466A_A14C_A75FD5928ADF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5dfe0cfa46a9ba5d4c267855ad34f4c2507e669ff352f238f1da5f244f7db28
#. default-sha256: ad14a892b8522e61f0262959199f48e7cf99f58c676e74107d2f72a4b37e0cde
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_111F5064_ADFE_466A_A14C_A75FD5928ADF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫...Master. Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫……旦那さま、⟪k:9⟫旦那さま。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_11F56EE0_9C38_4F29_B74A_6FCC8A325BC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9980a81f8c981a29b07e121412dc828603a8eab75a1b15ae099de5b530247459
#. default-sha256: 4844298aa2ea26aae051ae6ccfd98d33dba5f6a95e2fb0394ca5845a54f230b8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_11F56EE0_9C38_4F29_B74A_6FCC8A325BC3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ahh... ⟪k:1⟫you have awakened. ⟪k:2⟫You gave me quite the startle."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ああ……目を覚まされたのですね？　⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫わたくし、⟪k:3⟫とっても驚きましたわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_89EE87C6_5B9A_4A0A_A1DF_5919B15040CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 884422733c349c4c8631903397a6900b83bed04828feb23b8e41f9718a2c5c7d
#. default-sha256: 2a5de12ede59a7bcdad935bd24b7f83772b8757cf894494faad995592abb273f
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_89EE87C6_5B9A_4A0A_A1DF_5919B15040CC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do you not remember? ⟪k:1⟫You suddenly started staring off into the distance, and you would "
"not respond to anything I said."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫覚えていないんですの？　⟪k:1⟫急に遠い目をされて、⟪k:2⟫わたくしの言葉を聞いて下さらなくなった"
"んですよ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_1CC76CC7_F747_47C2_8887_23081832279C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa136fb27f76599ee0403511bf61c700e5007c3160ef3802ed5c25a437c9903a
#. default-sha256: 65c1fba594d1a56e6c3e93ebc795bc051040915bc2481a655996411f4f8bfcad
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1CC76CC7_F747_47C2_8887_23081832279C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehe. I thought you were playing a prank on me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ふふ、⟪k:1⟫いじわるされたのだと思ってしまいましたわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_1AD64425_BDF5_4EA6_9999_FD49546236A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 392ef0325ed06670853d084f842b6dfeb5d30144a5acad16114ca96351bb1892
#. default-sha256: 26e972292aea0db53b79f9eba1c0fc3653ebaef0a24086d8d1248ef35be27c82
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1AD64425_BDF5_4EA6_9999_FD49546236A4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Your hand? ⟪k:1⟫Oh, yes, I did not let go of it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫手、⟪k:1⟫ですか？　⟪k:2⟫ええ、⟪k:3⟫ずっと繋いでおりましたわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_1A399BDF_5BE1_4A36_AB0A_D560CD523861
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4deffdcbd2e3b523eb5c6d1fca00a19ac7ea57efd4cf63c2604e8f24584124d4
#. default-sha256: eafbf84c183bbe9b18d3713231ba17735bd11c0c23fafd0604f5068648ea851e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1A399BDF_5BE1_4A36_AB0A_D560CD523861"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For if I had, we would be in quite the predicament."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だって……⟪k:1⟫わたくしがあなた様の手を離したら、⟪k:2⟫大変なことになってしまいますもの。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_F848F63F_7A17_4B90_B2F5_A318014EACD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f97c8be91d3fee6b62b41a97ee13a2ba0c5b9d5d780e48b30f690a2873f1606f
#. default-sha256: da633c116b26ed3670778d077a05d57e006a1d1c7dded735a3919299dbb5fc58
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F848F63F_7A17_4B90_B2F5_A318014EACD6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Someone approaching the mansion, you say? ⟪k:1⟫You saw them?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫まあ……⟪k:1⟫誰かがお屋敷に近付こうとしている？⟪k:2⟫　その光景を見たと言うのですか？"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A1598863_CBF6_41E4_BCFE_3F9793B411E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ca003b044264713d88761d0cdf64d0ee145700408b416276ef8714c55f80ee8
#. default-sha256: 2c83e69fe28d282fbc47340dec10608a428488b1cd53dd73d0c48cab8924196d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A1598863_CBF6_41E4_BCFE_3F9793B411E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Those images... ⟪k:1⟫were not shown to you by me. ⟪k:2⟫If you saw something, then it was by "
"your own powers."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それは……⟪k:1⟫わたくしがお見せしたものではありませんわ。⟪k:2⟫あなた様が何かを見たというのなら"
"ば、⟪k:3⟫それは、⟪k:4⟫あなた様のお力。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_71F90BF4_07DD_4E07_A132_1B71D3313736
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e333d754cf79e927a54607e4aa405b9b0923139bc21bbaca0743d039279c747
#. default-sha256: fe939025a056befe4c8dfb262069bc65cb4c9af8e89985c05e66b5682dbd7d79
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_71F90BF4_07DD_4E07_A132_1B71D3313736"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But if you think about it, that is nothing unusual."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫でも、⟪k:1⟫考えてみたらおかしなことではありませんね。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_2BC8B724_D335_4767_B5CD_FCB8966C49A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6400f5505275930d08ffad69299e5cfb4c7862b31603ba8d9e7e6a50d56fd9a8
#. default-sha256: 7292b9322531b758889c421cdec0a89dd2f0a4b77b5565c9f8151b9e7c1c27af
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2BC8B724_D335_4767_B5CD_FCB8966C49A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You are, after all, the master of this house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あなた様は、⟪k:1⟫お屋敷の主でございます。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_1B8C40FB_85CC_4FE2_AC7E_E24F642F5E44
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5d42eefd430cf5768b9fbb9f30e61821bb3d1935d15c15e6f4607a49e512bcc7
#. default-sha256: dcdc01b4d47790aa0e7130b24c9f0008f46ab19c8adf81059437ae4caff5c163
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_1B8C40FB_85CC_4FE2_AC7E_E24F642F5E44"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You should, in all actuality, be able to do anything I can do by yourself, Master."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたくしが出来ることも、⟪k:1⟫本来であれば、⟪k:2⟫あなた様おひとりで可能なのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7E71B94D_DC7F_4E9D_A51F_AD26D219E9FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9b661ae2be34be3373cd509855a4701699b7956ff1344d0f7560f2e81465481
#. default-sha256: 7afcb69c4ab5e3dbddcb7fe152667e14af5eee2a91f9f0f29195d33118dd3caf
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7E71B94D_DC7F_4E9D_A51F_AD26D219E9FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So it is very possible you could have knowledge that I do not."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫だから……⟪k:1⟫わたくしの知らないことをあなた様が知ったとしても、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫あり得なくはありませ"
"んわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_6E2FABCA_9F64_48A0_B7E6_6CD0ADBD4555
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1de45e969cb61de0f7f4da652b8004ab77466c31fc73e6fad62536c3d4ee1e4
#. default-sha256: b66e6d1bff9fc053a37cc20ffbe52ebdb07fed52aaf3d32d294d6f376074222b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_6E2FABCA_9F64_48A0_B7E6_6CD0ADBD4555"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, let us return to the mansion’s tale."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫さあ、⟪k:1⟫お屋敷の話に戻りましょう。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0F1BEE93_B1C4_4A09_B39D_E7D9E7B6F528
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c363012251b9a793baa68fb3fe0aff2fea989fd30c71f1958c43ba17ef36e478
#. default-sha256: ba621f9363e5d06c7e8a4bd7e03d3608d0dfa02e6efcd7cd3492cf45e060ec5b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0F1BEE93_B1C4_4A09_B39D_E7D9E7B6F528"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫After the second beast paid a visit, Bestia began to destabilize again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ベステアと同じ獣が現れてから、⟪k:1⟫彼はまた不安定になっておりました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9192764E_EBB3_456D_8944_942876725FB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f71e12184cbec66a8ea5deaf26fdb11af0c46df0a46fad870b719014da0fbc66
#. default-sha256: 2f124d23cf41b35ab72c113d8934acfa60be6076c5c400e6cfddf0d8c490c33a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9192764E_EBB3_456D_8944_942876725FB3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl would soothe his heart, but the calm was only ephemeral."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫白い髪の娘が彼の心を癒やしても、⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫落ち着きを取り戻すのは一時のこと。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_E9596033_9464_4E27_AE7A_5F6978E107B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 544f6c83bf86c35440efe5cc48f6dc4b514f2a14522c923a2022ea834dc7d5a3
#. default-sha256: c28c0db050b76f9e7f460da528b7ce1cfaa78627e5c2ca5e29baa9f135399600
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E9596033_9464_4E27_AE7A_5F6978E107B7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was like a cracked glass ball."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫まるで彼は、⟪k:1⟫亀裂の入ったガラス玉でございました。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_A0605F8E_692A_4C13_9EBC_6804BCFE93B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e1fd75558acbf76717ec683fbb3dbe87fc8336bbdd116450f451ec5b4bc78da
#. default-sha256: 8db8b39e4bff65c12ee9ae5e97c0a14ccdeb7e91086e5722994bdc66c3a9c549
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A0605F8E_692A_4C13_9EBC_6804BCFE93B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If you dropped him, that would be the end. ⟪k:1⟫If you put too much force into handling him, "
"he would shatter. ⟪k:2⟫He was very difficult to care for."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫落としては一貫の終わり、⟪k:1⟫力を入れ過ぎても壊れてしまう――⟪k:2⟫扱いの大変困難なものです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0B4F9443_56C3_456D_B951_B6010DA695FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7a547da08570165542c34b48c10bb8563317a6f0b7f954262ac402c347e0d2a4
#. default-sha256: b24ab927fbe06827b7ed2f9f58bab20f53a81dfbe46b166205dce1274ae36415
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0B4F9443_56C3_456D_B951_B6010DA695FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And cracks do not heal. ⟪k:1⟫The damage still remains, even if the two sides appear to be "
"held together firmly in place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それに、⟪k:1⟫罅というのは直らないんですのよ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫くっついたように見えても痕跡は残りま"
"す。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_5A7A7FC0_467A_41A0_9F25_8AB72A3349B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 091d05cf507068554c24fd0ec3a9c09967c9ab0ba20c4e3aa59534d1322ae835
#. default-sha256: 24aea7b1f01898d8259cc7dd3f849fe6d88e9493fd49e16ce7615a79f04905d0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_5A7A7FC0_467A_41A0_9F25_8AB72A3349B6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Furthermore, they slowly, gradually, and without intervention spread."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そして、⟪k:1⟫ゆっくりとゆっくりと、⟪k:2⟫自然に広がっていくのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_F3BEFB24_9F16_4AFE_BBF4_CCCC02D9858D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca34d6a259172fb6721374978b1dea318a90b6606174f5a188d3eafc321e31b8
#. default-sha256: 0fd4d1a9a57fad690302c343539a8dee2f350c37a8cdf57bf3a98bc53b197b28
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F3BEFB24_9F16_4AFE_BBF4_CCCC02D9858D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The beast appeared to be afraid of someone’s voice."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫獣は、⟪k:1⟫何者かの声に怯えているようでした。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3CCE8F83_81C4_47D8_99D2_C77A99D5C210
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5be9e5cc356044789eb96048e3da82969b5fb84777ed5a281745cd61a0777b25
#. default-sha256: 5c5041a9fb50b92b5898aababa1b683b4937b053879c09b946f4de682ee45b8c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3CCE8F83_81C4_47D8_99D2_C77A99D5C210"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He would on occasion stare into empty space and shout, cover his ears, and groan."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫時折虚空を見つめては怒鳴り声を上げ、⟪k:1⟫耳を塞ぎ、⟪k:2⟫唸るのです。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3602D6A7_C211_42BD_B283_E0DEACB10FD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf94b82d13124ff6369b0df329db8b6a97f79abc41cae658a42744c3dc2d8e9e
#. default-sha256: 83192c3c7be99f8c578a8cf57f6e32d1df79556904e7639b2daf61d1cfe36b8d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3602D6A7_C211_42BD_B283_E0DEACB10FD7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One day, he shattered all the windows in the mansion, crushed the silverware I had just "
"polished to a shine..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ある時はお屋敷の窓を壊そうとしたり、⟪k:1⟫せっかくわたくしが磨いたつるりとした食器の数々を粉々"
"にしたり……。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_E717A328_7A1E_4C98_AEC3_5BA798EE0BCD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c0fe3112672aa519ec9e8de6e7f3a7c45f9bae355d15a3ff96a795ea8e2eec4
#. default-sha256: 3d586fe52402957fbf19e692b48613501f0f70576c53735a83b73e77bb84af15
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E717A328_7A1E_4C98_AEC3_5BA798EE0BCD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and destroyed all the mirrors."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そう、⟪k:1⟫姿見も壊しましたわ。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_3D6268C8_5E43_4895_85B3_41C34C8C23E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 48a05cc95da7b18188379779f1a6323e4cd838583dca8fc00d314d4aa34d9fcf
#. default-sha256: d69e76c11734ecb027600a97adaae9131d974cf42b4881e7ab66af2af928eba9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_3D6268C8_5E43_4895_85B3_41C34C8C23E7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I assume he did not want to see his beastly self."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫きっと――⟪k:1⟫獣である自分の姿を、⟪k:2⟫見たくなかったのでしょうね。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_E6660BE9_C4A9_4F2A_900C_9387CC154EA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40e2733f3ef274750109f1df8ee6043b9d54eadb4fc104d71fea7fbcfcf53d08
#. default-sha256: 905035a83c30d05b80bd5236ea3793ec5e16644c9e819f2acaf612c9a1daca7c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E6660BE9_C4A9_4F2A_900C_9387CC154EA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫More... ⟪k:10⟫There’s more!⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫There’s "
"still more that reflects my image!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫\t\t\t\t⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫まだ……、⟪k:10⟫まだだ！　⟪k:11⟫まだ……"
"⟪k:12⟫おれを映すものがある！"

#: scenario2:scenario2_0E8A774D_89D2_40BB_B08E_32EBA92EA1AD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96a9bc1095b3a735f4b87e9be79f6d8cc46e563a04ef4f0b3930c2f2901f79fa
#. default-sha256: f28da531f03af5396634db675b5b266bdc95a587bafcfc3c173635387fd2d65c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0E8A774D_89D2_40BB_B08E_32EBA92EA1AD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Windows! Mirrors! Vases! Dishes!⟪k:1⟫They all show my reflection!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫窓も！　⟪k:1⟫鏡も！　⟪k:2⟫壺も！　⟪k:3⟫食器もだ……⟪k:4⟫おれを映す！"

#: scenario2:scenario2_30E1C98F_85D0_415D_9596_F850209C4998
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
